    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Focused Chain-of-Thought: Efficient LLM Reasoning via Structured Input Information
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Struppek%2C+L">Lukas Struppek</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Hintersdorf%2C+D">Dominik Hintersdorf</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Struppek%2C+H">Hannah Struppek</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Neider%2C+D">Daniel Neider</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Kersting%2C+K">Kristian Kersting</a>
      
