          F.3.1; D.2.4; I.2.3
        
      </p>
    

    
  </li>

  <li class="arxiv-result">
    <div class="is-marginless">
      <p class="list-title is-inline-block"><a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2511.21103">arXiv:2511.21103</a>
        <span>&nbsp;[<a href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2511.21103">pdf</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/ps/2511.21103">ps</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/format/2511.21103">other</a>]&nbsp;</span>
      </p>
      <div class="tags is-inline-block">
